<div id="video">
  <section-header/>

  <h3 id="video-base">Base Video</h3>
  <p>
    The <code>video</code> block wraps a native <code>&lt;video&gt;</code>
    element and a <code>video__controls</code> bar. The control bar is a flex
    row that sizes to 100% of the container. Time labels are
    <code>&lt;span&gt;</code> elements using the <code>video__timestamp</code>
    class. The scrubber range input uses <code>video__scrubber</code> to fill
    remaining space. All buttons in the bar use <code>video__control</code> — a
    bare, unstyled button with only a pressed state.
  </p>

  <component-demo component="video" variant="base"/>

  <h3 id="video-popover-control">Popover Controls</h3>
  <p>
    The control bar may contain buttons that open popovers.
    <code>video__popover-container</code> anchors a <code>video__popover</code>
    to its trigger, shown while the trigger is <code>aria-expanded="true"</code>.
    Add <code>video__popover-container--hover</code> instead to reveal the popover
    on hover and focus, as the volume slider does.
  </p>

  <component-demo component="video" variant="captionsPopover"/>
  <component-demo component="video" variant="volumePopover"/>

  <h3 id="video-controls-variants">Control Bar Variants</h3>
  <p>
    Without a scrubber, <code>video__timestamp--remaining</code> sizes the
    countdown to its content and <code>video__spacer</code> pushes the buttons
    to the trailing edge. While the media plays,
    <code>video__controls--hidden</code> fades the whole bar out; it returns
    whenever something inside it takes focus.
  </p>

  <component-demo component="video" variant="withoutSeek"/>

  <h3 id="video-overlays">Overlays</h3>
  <p>
    <code>video__overlay</code> centers content over the video for error and
    loading states (add <code>video__overlay--transparent</code> for a spinner
    without a scrim). <code>video__play-overlay</code> is a full-bleed poster
    play button, and <code>video__nav</code> is a full-bleed overlay link
    rendered under the control bar.
  </p>

  <component-demo component="video" variant="errorOverlay"/>
  <component-demo component="video" variant="loadingOverlay"/>
  <component-demo component="video" variant="playOverlay"/>
  <component-demo component="video" variant="navLink"/>
</div>
